<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Link-in-Bio</h1>
<p>Create a personal or brand landing page with all your important links in one place. Perfect for Instagram, TikTok, Twitter, and more.</p>

<h2>Setting Up Your Bio Page</h2>
<ol><li>Go to <strong>Account → Link-in-Bio</strong></li><li>Choose a unique <strong>username</strong> (your page URL will be <code>/bio/username</code>)</li><li>Add your <strong>display name</strong>, <strong>bio text</strong>, and <strong>avatar</strong></li><li>Add your <strong>social links</strong> (Twitter, Instagram, LinkedIn, GitHub, YouTube, TikTok)</li><li>Add your <strong>links</strong> with titles and URLs</li></ol>

<h2>Themes</h2>
<p>Choose from 5 built-in themes: <strong>Default</strong>, <strong>Minimal</strong>, <strong>Neon</strong>, <strong>Gradient</strong>, <strong>Glass</strong></p>

<h2>Customization</h2>
<ul><li>Background color</li><li>Text color</li><li>Button style (rounded, square, pill)</li><li>Drag-and-drop link ordering</li></ul>

<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>Track views on your bio page and clicks on each individual link.</p>
